{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>On the fifteenth day.</b> The date of this encampment is specified because on that day the matzah-dough they brought out of Egypt was exhausted and they needed the manna — to teach us that they ate from the leftover dough for sixty-one meals, and the manna fell for them on the sixteenth of Iyyar, which was the first day of the week, as is found in tractate Shabbat (chapter 7)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:52:35.851464528Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}